{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"effective-interest-rate-calculator UI copy.howAnswer","detected_language":"ms","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"effective-interest-rate-calculator.copy.howAnswer","keys":["effective-interest-rate-calculator.copy.howAnswer"],"locale":"ms","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Untuk penggabungan berkala, APY = (ZXQPH0000QXZ + APR ÷ m)^m − ZXQPH0001QXZ, di mana m ialah bilangan tempoh penggabungan setiap tahun. Untuk menukar APY kembali kepada APR nominal, gunakan APR = m × ((ZXQPH0002QXZ + APY)^(ZXQPH0003QXZ/m) − ZXQPH0004QXZ). Penggabungan berterusan menggunakan APY = e^APR − ZXQPH0005QXZ. Masukkan kadar sebagai peratusan; contohnya, ZXQPH0006QXZ bermakna ZXQPH0007QXZ.","record_id":"4e7e9268407a2170a0f0aaa9988dcb296af07568b5f51b5ab95dbd03992713b9","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40565692987","seconds":3.54755408799997,"source":"For periodic compounding, APY = (1 + APR ÷ m)^m − 1, where m is the number of compounding periods per year. To convert APY back to nominal APR, use APR = m × ((1 + APY)^(1/m) − 1). Continuous compounding uses APY = e^APR − 1. Enter rates as percentages; for example, 12 means 12%.","source_commit":"e8a7cb94dc75d40f2c0e14bb27c0a1819e230012","source_hash":"fe78b074adbd1d99e0a797d7cf4aab3016d94b38ff9812d5eef74ae6613339fa","status":"machine-draft","translation":"Untuk penggabungan berkala, APY = (1 + APR ÷ m)^m − 1, di mana m ialah bilangan tempoh penggabungan setiap tahun. Untuk menukar APY kembali kepada APR nominal, gunakan APR = m × ((1 + APY)^(1/m) − 1). Penggabungan berterusan menggunakan APY = e^APR − 1. Masukkan kadar sebagai peratusan; contohnya, 12 bermakna 12%.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
